{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14288","headline":"同王晦伯朱遐景宿慧山寺 · 窦羣","name":"同王晦伯朱遐景宿慧山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共访青山寺，曾隐南朝人。\n问古松桂老，开襟言笑新。\n步移月亦出，水映石磷磷。\n予洗肠中酒，君濯缨上尘。\n皓彩入幽抱，清气逼苍旻。\n信此澹忘归，淹留冰玉邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦羣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}